In the afternoon, I left the town center.
There was a lot of crowd there.
I set off towards a famous viewpoint.
I started my walk there.
The road was winding and went upwards.
I walked slowly.
The weather was very pleasant.
A cool wind was blowing.
Mumbai city is always busy and noisy.
There, my own life is also fast-paced.
But here, there was complete peace.
In this quiet environment, I experienced a lot of joy.
On the way, I saw another traveler.
He was carrying his own heavy bag.
He was very tired.
But I only had my own small bag with me.
Therefore, my walk was easy.
Looking at the beauty of nature, I went ahead.
Slowly, I reached near the top of the hill.
